{
  "id": "279",
  "title": "The Panda's Regret",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-04-01",
  "synopsis": "Do you know what the giant panda's biggest regret in life is?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/380/b0b4e510c791a5ba52f12410c23058efeb3c55f8.mp3?1489606883",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "熊猫的遗憾\n\n    你知道大熊猫一生中最大的遗憾是什么吗？\n    这是一个脑筋急转弯，你知道答案吗？\n    答案是：它没有彩色相片。因为大熊猫身上只有黑色和白色。",
    "traditional": "熊貓的遺憾\n\n    你知道大熊貓一生中最大的遺憾是什麼嗎？\n    這是一個腦筋急轉彎，你知道答案嗎？\n    答案是：它沒有彩色相片。因為大熊貓身上只有黑色和白色。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Panda's Regret"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "你知道大熊猫一生中最大的遗憾是什么吗？",
      "traditional": "你知道大熊貓一生中最大的遺憾是什麼嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhī dào dà xióng māo yì shēng zhōng zuì dà de yí hàn shì shén me ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you know what the giant panda's biggest regret in life is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "这是一个脑筋急转弯，你知道答案吗？",
      "traditional": "這是一個腦筋急轉彎，你知道答案嗎？",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yí ge nǎo jīn jí zhuǎn wān nǐ zhī dào dá àn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is a brain teaser. Do you know the answer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "答案是：它没有彩色相片。",
      "traditional": "答案是：它沒有彩色相片。",
      "pinyin": "dá àn shì tā méi yǒu cǎi sè xiàng piàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "因为大熊猫身上只有黑色和白色。",
      "traditional": "因為大熊貓身上只有黑色和白色。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi dà xióng māo shēn shang zhǐ yǒu hēi sè hé bái sè",
      "english": "The answer is: It doesn't have any color photos."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Because the giant panda only has black and white on its body."
    }
  ],
